# OPD-SAATHI

### Smart Outpatient Department (OPD) Assistance Platform

OPD-SAATHI is a smart hospital assistance platform designed to improve the outpatient experience in government hospitals.

## Objectives
- Simplify patient registration.
- Help patients track OPD queues.
- Provide information about doctors.
- Help users find nearby hospitals.
- Support hospital staff with a dashboard.

## Key Features
- Patient registration
- OPD queue tracking
- Doctor information
- Nearby hospital map
- OPD slip interface
- Staff dashboard
- Multilingual interface and speech assistance

## Technology
This project contains separate client and server folders, along with application data and configuration files.

